{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03234","headline":"伤王七秘书监寄呈扬州陆长史通简府僚广陵以广好事 · 宋之问","name":"伤王七秘书监寄呈扬州陆长史通简府僚广陵以广好事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王氏贵先宗，衡门栖道风。\n传心晤有物，秉化游无穷。\n学奥九流异，机玄三语同。\n书乃墨场绝，文称词伯雄。\n白屋藩魏主，苍生期谢公。\n一祗贤良诏，遂谒承明宫。\n补衮望奚塞，尊儒位未充。\n罢官七门里，归老一丘中。\n尝忝长者辙，微言私谓通。\n我行会稽郡，路出广陵东。\n物在人已矣，都疑淮海空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}